---

<BaseLayout>
  <div class="container">
    <section class="page__hero" aria-labelledby="page-heading">
      <h1 id="page-heading" class="page__heading">Panel Cleaning</h1>
      <picture class="page__hero-img">
        <source srcset={cleaningImage.src} media="(min-width: 1200px)" />
        <source srcset={cleaningImage.src} media="(min-width: 600px)" />
        <img src={cleaningImage.src} alt="Panel Cleaning Image" />
      </picture>
      <p>
        Your solar panels work best when they’re clean. Over time, dust, dirt,
        bird droppings, pollen, and other debris can build up on the surface,
        reducing efficiency and lowering energy output. At Solar360 Energy, we
        provide professional solar panel cleaning services designed to help your
        system perform at its full potential while protecting your long-term
        investment.
      </p>
      <p>
        Using safe, non-abrasive cleaning methods, our team removes stubborn
        buildup without damaging your panels or voiding manufacturer warranties.
        Whether for residential or commercial systems, regular cleaning can
        improve performance, extend panel lifespan, and help you get the most
        from your solar energy system.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="page__main"></section>
    <FaqAccordion items={faqItems} />
    <div class="cta__transition">
      <p>Ready to improve your solar panel performance?</p>
    </div>
    <Cta />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
